   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Postgres 18, as of migration 20261030143522 (one squashed init). PK = primary key, FK = foreign key. Source of truth: db/migrations/*.sql (db/schema.sql is generated).\nAll times are timestamptz (stored as instants); the database and every app session use TimeZone = UTC.",
   "originalText": "Postgres 18, as of migration 20261030143522 (one squashed init). PK = primary key, FK = foreign key. Source of truth: db/migrations/*.sql (db/schema.sql is generated).\nAll times are timestamptz (stored as instants); the database and every app session use TimeZone = UTC.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
