   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "PK id             bigint       run number (identity)\n   kind           text         fetch | seed | sync\n   args           jsonb        what the run was asked for\n   status         text         running -> succeeded | failed\n   started_at     timestamptz  when the run began\n   finished_at    timestamptz  null while still running\n   trials_fetched integer      trials retrieved OK\n   trials_changed integer      new snapshots written\n   trials_failed  integer      trials that errored\n   error          text         why the run failed\n\ncheck: status = running <=> finished_at is null",
   "originalText": "PK id             bigint       run number (identity)\n   kind           text         fetch | seed | sync\n   args           jsonb        what the run was asked for\n   status         text         running -> succeeded | failed\n   started_at     timestamptz  when the run began\n   finished_at    timestamptz  null while still running\n   trials_fetched integer      trials retrieved OK\n   trials_changed integer      new snapshots written\n   trials_failed  integer      trials that errored\n   error          text         why the run failed\n\ncheck: status = running <=> finished_at is null",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
