   "text": "PK ct_number        text         -> trial: one row per trial\nFK fetch_run_id     bigint       -> fetch_run: seed run\n   source_file      text         CSV file name\n   verdict          text         legal_compliance_assessment\n   results_document text         full / incomplete / none\n   lay_summary      boolean      layperson summary posted\n   days_to_results  integer      only if reported fully\n   comment          text         reviewers' note, if any\n   content_hash     bytea(32)    sha256 of canonical JSON\n   payload          jsonb        CSV row as in the file\n\nverdict: reported fully on time / reported fully late /\nnot fully reported / extended / cancelled",
   "originalText": "PK ct_number        text         -> trial: one row per trial\nFK fetch_run_id     bigint       -> fetch_run: seed run\n   source_file      text         CSV file name\n   verdict          text         legal_compliance_assessment\n   results_document text         full / incomplete / none\n   lay_summary      boolean      layperson summary posted\n   days_to_results  integer      only if reported fully\n   comment          text         reviewers' note, if any\n   content_hash     bytea(32)    sha256 of canonical JSON\n   payload          jsonb        CSV row as in the file\n\nverdict: reported fully on time / reported fully late /\nnot fully reported / extended / cancelled",
